# Two keys pressed during the Space tap come after the space, in order. AC-4.
0 in key KEY_SPACE down
50 in key KEY_A down
100 in key KEY_B down
200 in key KEY_SPACE up
200 out key KEY_SPACE down
200 out key KEY_SPACE up
200 out key KEY_A down
200 out key KEY_B down
250 in key KEY_A up
250 out key KEY_A up
260 in key KEY_B up
260 out key KEY_B up
